=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  ports ufw-no-ss ----------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. The ufw host without ss (iproute2):$
# the Ports section is one row that says so. Item 1 installs$
# iproute2, as it does today.$
$
# UFW Firewall Configuration ###################################$
$
  [+] Firewall             + deny policy$
$
  ufw ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Installed            Yes$
  [+] Status               Active$
  [+] Incoming policy      Deny$
  [+] At boot              Yes$
$
  SSH ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] [::]:22              Allowed$
  [+] 0.0.0.0:22           Allowed$
  [?] Bound sockets        ss not installed$
$
  Rules --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] 22/tcp               Allow$
  [+] 80/tcp               Allow$
  [+] 443/tcp              Allow$
  [+] 8080/tcp             Allow$
  [+] 22/tcp (v6)          Allow$
  [+] 80/tcp (v6)          Allow$
  [+] 443/tcp (v6)         Allow$
  [+] 8080/tcp (v6)        Allow$
$
  Ports --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [?] Listening ports      ss not installed$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Install iproute2     Needed to check SSH gets through$
   2) Application Profiles Add, remove, apply$
   3) Trusted Interfaces   Add, remove, apply$
   4) Disable firewall     Stop ufw (not recommended)$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-4 or q]:$
$
$

